{
  "info": {
    "name": "NestMart API",
    "description": "NestMart backend API — Phase 3A/3B.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Run backend: `cd backend && npm run dev`\n2. Set `{{baseUrl}}` collection variable (default: http://localhost:5000)\n3. Run `Auth > Register` then `Auth > Verify OTP` (grab OTP from server logs), then `Auth > Login`\n4. Tokens from login are auto-saved to `{{accessToken}}` and `{{refreshToken}}`\n\nIncludes JWT access/refresh, Google OAuth login, email OTP verification, password reset, RBAC roles, and full REST resources (products, categories with nesting, cart, orders, users, reviews, coupons, admin).\n\nEvery request documents its expected response in its description.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
